5,1,1,talk,May,,"I checked the tally. The two nearest the door used it eleven times; the rest of us, four. Who’s actually using this?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,That’s the pattern I’ve noticed too. The noise and crumbs follow the same people.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,A room that serves only a few will quietly consume the time of the many.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want the actual numbers on paper before we agree to anything. Who is paying for this mess right now?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just want a place where we can actually talk without everyone staring.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, I’m looking into the invoices for outside hire and the quotes for the two fit-outs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I’m checking the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will examine the facilities callouts on this floor and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I’m checking the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I’m looking into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, that sounds lonely. I hope you find a spot where you can actually breathe.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I’ll see if the wall is the real problem.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"A room’s purpose is revealed by the silence it leaves behind, not just the noise it makes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, @Sakura, you’re both checking the same things? That’s efficient, I guess.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
