35,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Sakura, the invoices show we paid 68,000 yen last year for nine bookings. That’s a lot for a room we barely use.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: The wall is just one sheet of plasterboard. I can hear every word from my desk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: Eleven callouts for equipment, zero for the empty store. The hours vanish into maintenance, not use.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @May, I got the quotes too. Screen setup is 141,000 yen, kitchen is 96,000. Which one is worth the money?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, that wall is terrible. I found the last awkward talk happened right here, in front of everyone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Sakura, 141,000 yen for a screen? That’s steep. I’m looking at the kitchen quote too.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Kenji, that explains the silence. I found crumbs under three keyboards; the mess is right here, not in the room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: The fridge clearing proved the same person always does the work. We must stop letting one person carry the burden.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @May, 96,000 yen for a kitchen? That’s cheaper, but who cleans it? I need to know the upkeep cost.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, so the mess is actually at our desks? That changes things. I’m still looking for a safe place to talk.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Sakura, the kitchen is cheaper, but the invoices prove we already overspend. I’m leaning toward the meeting space.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, if the mess is at our desks, a kitchen just moves the problem. I prefer a quiet room.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,- **Servas**: The store room needed no callouts. Simplicity saves the hours we are too tired to count.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @May, the meeting space costs more, but the invoices show we waste money on outside hires. I vote for that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that thin, a quiet room is impossible. I need a bookable space where we can actually speak freely.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Kenji, a bookable space solves the staring problem. I’m with you on that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Kenji, a bookable space with a screen might actually work. I’m leaning that way now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,The hours saved by simplicity are the truest wealth. I support the bookable space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Servas: The hours saved by simplicity are the truest wealth. I support the bookable space.""}]}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@May, the numbers back you up. I’m voting for the meeting space too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@May, @Misaki, @Servas, @Sakura, I’m voting for the meeting space. It’s the only option that gives us a real place to talk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki"",""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
